Publication and distribution.</span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; A.&nbsp; The department of elections
shall publish and distribute a local voters' pamphlet in conformity with
chapter 29A.32 RCW for all primary, general and special elections.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; B.&nbsp; The countywide pamphlet shall
