<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 1.&nbsp; All King County elective
offices and ballot measures; and</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
